  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">This activity Funding to MedAccess is a component of UK investment in the Global Fund 2020-2022 to reduce transmission and mortality for HIV AIDS, tuberculosis and malaria through treatments, diagnostics and preventive technologies and related services reported by FCDO with a funding type of 111 - Not for profit organisation and a budget of &#xA3;9,569,997. This project benefits Developing countries, unspecified. It works in the following sector(s): Health policy and administrative management.</narrative>
